              data-body="Hi Zulfan, I explored your AeroScan YOLOv11 + TensorRT work and stopped by the Poké-Café! Would love to connect for a coffee chat regarding AI / Computer Vision engineering."
            >
              <div class="font-pixel text-[10px] text-emerald-200">🔬 Edge AI & Computer Vision</div>
