            <button
              type="button"
              class="vip-chat-topic rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/25 bg-black/30 p-2.5 text-left hover:border-emerald-400/60 transition"
              data-subject="Project Collaboration & Architecture Inquiry"
              data-body="Hi Zulfan, I'm reaching out from your Poké-Café VIP Booth! We have an upcoming web/AI project and would love to discuss scope, architecture, and availability over a virtual coffee."
            >
              <div class="font-pixel text-[10px] text-emerald-200">🛠️ Freelance & Custom Build</div>
              <div class="font-mono text-[10px] text-emerald-300/75 mt-0.5">Custom Web Platform or AI Prototype</div>
